.git
**/target/
**/*.txt
/docker/
!/target/release/polkadot-collator
/zombienet/

# dotfiles in the repo root
/.*
# ...except the cargo config: it carries WASM_BUILD_RUSTFLAGS (--import-undefined),
# without which the runtime blob fails to link every sp-io/cumulus `ext_*` host
# function. Excluding it makes the image build fail while local builds pass.
!/.cargo
!/.cargo/**
